# Optional. Leave unset in development: the Vite dev server proxies
# /api/munsit/* -> https://api.munsit.com (see vite.config.ts).
#
# In production, set this to your own backend base URL that forwards requests
# to https://api.munsit.com/api/v1 and injects the x-api-key server-side.
# VITE_MUNSIT_API_BASE=https://your-backend.example.com/munsit/api/v1
